                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 💬 Messenger Auto-Reply (Gemini)\n\nReplies to DMs on the **Unique Names** page in a warm, human grandmother voice.\nGemini drafts the reply from the knowledge base; confident answers are sent\nautomatically, tricky/sensitive ones are **escalated to Slack** for a human.\n\nHandles baby-name suggestions + parenting questions.",
                                         "height":  250,
                                         "width":  560,
                                         "color":  4
                                     },
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "typeVersion":  1,
                      "position":  [
                                       -780,
                                       -380
                                   ],
                      "id":  "sticky-overview",
                      "name":  "Sticky Overview"
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## ⚙️ SETUP (one-time)\n\n1. **Activate** this workflow (the webhook only goes live when active).\n2. In your **Meta app** → Messenger → Webhooks: callback URL =\n   `https://n8n.srv1193790.hstgr.cloud/webhook/fb-messenger`\n   verify token = `uniquenames_verify_2026`; subscribe to `messages`.\n3. Subscribe the **Page** to the app; page token needs `pages_messaging`.\n4. Bot persona/rules live in the **Setup (KB + Config)** node.\n5. Escalations post to Slack channel — swap to a #fb-messenger channel later.",
                                         "height":  250,
                                         "width":  560,
                                         "color":  3
                                     },
