                                                                             "content":  "=You are replying as the Unique Names page team.\n\n{{ $json.kb }}\n\n----\nThe person just sent this message on Messenger:\n\"{{ $json.userText }}\"\n\nWrite your reply now. Return ONLY the JSON object described above — no code fences, no extra text."
